{"title":"2011 IMO Shortlist Problems/A1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given any set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/f/59f586d0452f0ce847ac06fa9b8a0024ccfffd41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\{a_1, a_2, a_3, a_4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" /> of four distinct positive integers, we denote the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/3/75391109812e189de2b8ed57268ad22206a03c92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 +a_2 +a_3 +a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"13\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/e/c4ea2f9ce788b497a2d5d56c3205ad0c82f9df92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fdb780be66bfbfb3082563bb7e174790920da0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" /> denote the number of pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811480f547c16afc74ffca555e4fd6c166ccfa68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i, j)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd6b1448ab9467cabf3bfde844192a67dd2fd434.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq  i &lt; j \\leq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/7/f57d5835a2f3454339c4378672a1fd0bc7d3abd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i +a_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/e/c4ea2f9ce788b497a2d5d56c3205ad0c82f9df92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. Find all sets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> of four distinct positive integers which achieve the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fdb780be66bfbfb3082563bb7e174790920da0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><i>Author: Fernando Campos, Mexico</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018054858\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 32/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1797/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12103:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018054858 and revision id 57416. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}